{"id":"641a3566187bf66b","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-huge.md","title":"Huge Cardinal","display":"df-huge — Huge Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-huge","aliases":["58-df-huge","58-df-huge-cardinal"],"display":"df-huge — Huge Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[58-df-satisfaction.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-huge"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-huge</span><span>58-df-huge-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-huge — Huge Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction.md\">58-df-satisfaction.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\">\\(\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}\\)</span>（元层类量词；其变元不被误当作 ZFC 集合）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}\\)</span>（语言 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\in\\}\">\\(\\{\\in\\}\\)</span> 的一阶公式码；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction.md\">58-df-satisfaction.md</a>）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}\">\\(\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}\\)</span>（下式定义的元层类初等等价模式）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Huge}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Huge}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>（本文件定义）</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,j\">\\(M,j\\)</span> 为元语言类，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:V\\to M\">\\(j:V\\to M\\)</span> 缩写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\subseteq V\\times M\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in M\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\">\\(j\\subseteq V\\times M\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in M\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)\\)</span>。满意关系、变量编码及有限赋值使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9976e7d9d98187f6\" href=\"?note=9976e7d9d98187f6\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md\">../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V^r\">\\(V^r\\)</span> 表示长度 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 的有限集合函数赋值类。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\lambda\\to M\">\\(f:\\lambda\\to M\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in V\">\\(f\\in V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\lambda\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\lambda\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 是单值函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf V=V\">\\(\\mathbf V=V\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}huge\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementarity}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;j:V\\to M\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to\n(\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}huge\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementarity}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;j:V\\to M\\land\n\\forall r\\in\\omega\\;\\forall\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in\\;\\forall\\vec a\\in V^r\\;\\\\\n&amp;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{FV}_{\\mathcal L_\\in}(\\varphi)\\subseteq\\{v_i:i&lt;r\\}\\to\n(\\langle V,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[\\vec a]\\leftrightarrow\n\\langle M,\\in\\rangle\\models\\varphi[j\\circ\\vec a])\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}huge} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;M\\subseteq\\mathbf V\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\\land j:\\mathbf V\\to M\\\\&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,\\mathbf V,M)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land j(\\kappa)=\\lambda\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl((f:\\lambda\\to M)\\longrightarrow f\\in M\\bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}huge} \\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}} \\mathrm{Huge}(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}M,j\\;\\exists\\lambda\\in V\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;M\\subseteq\\mathbf V\\land\\forall y\\in M\\;\\forall x\\in y\\;(x\\in M)\\land j:\\mathbf V\\to M\\\\&amp;\\land\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,\\mathbf V,M)\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(j(\\alpha)=\\alpha)\\land j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\land j(\\kappa)=\\lambda\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall f\\in V\\;\\bigl((f:\\lambda\\to M)\\longrightarrow f\\in M\\bigr)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> is huge if there is an elementary class embedding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j:\\mathbf V\\to M\">\\(j:\\mathbf V\\to M\\)</span> with critical point <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{\\lambda}\\subseteq M\">\\(M^{\\lambda}\\subseteq M\\)</span> where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=j(\\kappa)\">\\(\\lambda=j(\\kappa)\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\">\\(j\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是类而不是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 中的集合；类量词、类函数类型和真值子句均明确位于元层，未把真谓词编码成 ZFC 集合。</li>\n<li>临界点条件已显式展开为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j\\upharpoonright\\kappa=\\mathrm{id}_\\kappa\">\\(j\\upharpoonright\\kappa=\\mathrm{id}_\\kappa\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\">\\(j(\\kappa)\\neq\\kappa\\)</span>，从而排除恒等嵌入导致的定义坍缩。</li>\n<li>This is stronger than supercompact: supercompact requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{\\kappa} \\subseteq M\">\\(M^{\\kappa} \\subseteq M\\)</span>, huge requires <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M^{\\lambda} \\subseteq M\">\\(M^{\\lambda} \\subseteq M\\)</span></li>\n<li><code>58-df-huge-cardinal</code> is merged here.</li>\n<li>The consistency strength of &quot;there exists a huge cardinal&quot; is extremely high</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"8b6a90316aad78a4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}$（语言 $\\{\\in\\}$ 的一阶公式码；see [[58-df-satisfaction.md]]）","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md","status":"resolved","id":"9976e7d9d98187f6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle$，$\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)$。满意关系、变量编码及有限赋值使用 [[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]]；$V^r$ 表示长度 $r$ 的有限集合函数赋值类。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\in\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Huge}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"M,j","display":false},{"tex":"j:V\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"j\\subseteq V\\times M\\land\\forall x\\in V\\;\\exists!y\\in M\\;(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in j)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal L_\\in=\\langle\\{\\dot\\in\\},\\varnothing,\\varnothing,\\{\\langle\\dot\\in,2\\rangle\\}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_\\in=\\mathrm{Fml}_S(\\mathcal L_\\in)","display":false},{"tex":"V^r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\lambda\\to M","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(f)\\subseteq M","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf V=V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}huge\\text{-}class\\text{-}elementarity}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)\\leftr