_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}$, $\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$, $\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\in}$, $\\models$, and $\\mathrm{crit}$ are the predicates and operators fixed by [[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]]."},{"id":"0f80b1d285566dbe","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}$ (huge-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-huge]])"},{"id":"f93b4f900475f7b0","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}$ (huge-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]])"},{"id":"86ac87a3e29f09ca","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[58-df-huge.md]])"},{"id":"65571e2c2132ae57","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}$, $\\exists^{\\mathrm{Cls}}$, and $\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}$ are imported from [[58-df-huge]]"},{"id":"3fed66a0e7390f40","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Huge}:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (huge-cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-huge]])"},{"id":"e7499072623198aa","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Elem}^{\\mathrm{Cls}}_{\\in}(j,V,M)$ 使用 [[../batch18/58-df-huge.md]] 中以 [[../batch05/58-df-class-satisfaction.md]] 的满意关系展开的初等性模式。"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-172","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-huge]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-650","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-huge.md|58-df-huge]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["5fb1c2241d1943d1","8b6a90316aad78a4","9976e7d9d98187f6"]}